Package: librptadv-codec-g7111
Architecture: any
Depends: ${shlibs:Depends}, ${misc:Depends}
Description: protocol-neutral G.711 codec provider
 Versioned shared mu-law and A-law provider for RPT Advanced link adapters.

Package: librptadv-codec-dev
Section: libdevel
Architecture: any
Depends: librptadv-codec-g7111 (= ${binary:Version}), librptadv-codec-pcm1 (= ${binary:Version}), librptadv-codec-gsm1 (= ${binary:Version}), librptadv-codec-opus1 (= ${binary:Version}), librptadv-codec-speex1 (= ${binary:Version}), librptadv-codec-spandsp1 (= ${binary:Version}), ${misc:Depends}
Description: protocol-neutral codec provider development contract
 Public C header and development links for independently loaded providers.

Package: librptadv-codec-pcm1
Architecture: any
Depends: ${shlibs:Depends}, ${misc:Depends}
Description: protocol-neutral signed PCM codec provider
 Versioned big-endian 8 kHz and little-endian 16 kHz serialization provider.

Package: librptadv-codec-gsm1
Architecture: any
Depends: ${shlibs:Depends}, ${misc:Depends}
Description: protocol-neutral GSM FR codec provider
 Independent shared provider using the released dynamic libgsm library.

Package: librptadv-codec-opus1
Architecture: any
Depends: ${shlibs:Depends}, ${misc:Depends}
Description: protocol-neutral mono Opus codec provider
 Independent shared provider using the released dynamic libopus library.

Package: librptadv-codec-speex1
Architecture: any
Depends: ${shlibs:Depends}, ${misc:Depends}
Description: protocol-neutral narrowband and wideband Speex provider
 Independent shared provider using the released dynamic libspeex library.

Package: librptadv-codec-spandsp1
Architecture: any
Depends: ${shlibs:Depends}, ${misc:Depends}
Description: protocol-neutral G726, G722 and LPC10 providers
 Independent shared provider using the released dynamic SpanDSP library.
